# Project content policy
# Keep only project-owned Wacom assets versioned. Ignore other Content assets
# by default so large marketplace/reference imports do not enter source control.
Content/*
!Content/Wacom/
!Content/Wacom/**

# Version the formal Wacom card runtime materials generated by DreamShader.
# Keep every other DreamMaterials experiment/local output ignored.
!Content/DreamMaterials/
Content/DreamMaterials/*
!Content/DreamMaterials/M_CosmicBlob*.uasset
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/
Content/DreamMaterials/Card/*
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/M_CardSurface_CosmicFoil*.uasset
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/M_FirstPersonCard_Fake3D.uasset
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/M_FirstPersonCard_FeedbackEdge*.uasset
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/M_FirstPersonCard_PileTransferGlyph.uasset
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/M_FirstPersonCard_SurfaceEffects*.uasset
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/M_WacomCard*.uasset
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/MI_FirstPersonCard_PileTransferGlyph_Default.uasset
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/MI_FirstPersonCard_SurfaceEffects_*_Default.uasset
!Content/DreamMaterials/Card/MI_WacomCard*.uasset

# Keep project source, config, Wacom content, plugins, and docs versioned.
